msgstr "Fichiers"

#: lumos.fields.dataproduct:17 of
msgid ""
"FITS (:meth:`DataProduct.to_fits`): the data in the primary HDU with "
"``BUNIT`` and a linear WCS "
"(``CTYPE``/``CUNIT``/``CRPIX``/``CRVAL``/``CDELT``) for every regularly "
"sampled axis, then the extensions ``MASK``, ``UNCERT``, ``AXIS<i>`` "
"(exact coordinates) and ``META`` (JSON)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.fields.dataproduct:20 of
