"Every action, wait and numerical choice of a context is recorded as a "
":class:`JournalEntry` in ``ctx.journal`` and emitted through the standard"
" :mod:`logging` module on the ``lumos.context`` logger, with the entry "
"attached to the record as ``record.lumos`` (a JSON-compatible "
"dictionary). :class:`JsonFormatter` writes such records as one JSON "
"object per line, ready for log files and the web interface."
