#: lumos.elements.photonics.kernel_nuller:3 of
msgid ""
"A real Hadamard nuller sends the on-axis light to output 0 and makes "
"three dark outputs; each dark output is split in two and the copies are "
"combined pairwise in quadrature by 50/50 couplers. The kernels are the "
"differences of the outputs of each coupler, listed in "
":data:`KERNEL_PAIRS` (:func:`kernels`)."
msgstr ""

