"for an emulated camera."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.elements.detectors.Camera.expose:1 of
msgid ""
"Take an exposure: the clock advances by the exposure time and a new frame"
" is drawn."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.elements.detectors.Camera.transfer:1 of
msgid "Return the image in ADU."
msgstr ""

