msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.surveys.survey_component:9 of
msgid "Other fields of the component (spectrum, temperature, position...)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra:1 of
msgid "Spectra and filter curves read from catalogues (steps P9.3 to P9.5)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra:3 of
msgid ""
":class:`Spectrum` holds a spectral flux density per unit wavelength "
":math:`F_\\lambda` with its provenance; :class:`FilterCurve` a "
"transmission curve. Both interpolate linearly in wavelength."
