"Flux density of magnitude 0 in the photometric system of the filter, if "
"known."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.FilterCurve.at:1 of
msgid ""
"Return the transmission interpolated at ``wavelength`` (zero outside the "
"curve)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.FilterCurve.effective_wavelength:1 of
