"Return the mean wavelength :math:`\\int \\lambda T\\,d\\lambda / \\int "
"T\\,d\\lambda`."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.Spectrum:1 of
msgid "A spectral flux density with its provenance."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.Spectrum:3 of
msgid "Vacuum wavelengths, increasing."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.Spectrum:5 of
