msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.Spectrum:13 of
msgid "Reference of the spectrum (file, bibcode)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.catalogs.spectra.Spectrum.at:1 of
msgid ""
"Return the flux interpolated linearly at ``wavelength`` (zero outside the"
