#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:1 of
msgid ""
"From grids to expressions: modal projections, fits and regressions (step "
"P10.5, REQ-SYM-3)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:3 of
msgid ""
"Every function returns a :class:`Reconstruction`: a "
":class:`~lumos.symbolic.SymbolicField`, the coefficients or parameters "
"found, the relative error :math:`\\|U - \\hat U\\|_2 / \\|U\\|_2` on the "
"grid (``residual``) and the method used."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:7 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":func:`project_zernike`: phase of a field over a circular pupil on Noll's"
" Zernike modes (Noll 1976), by least squares; the expression is "
":math:`\\bar A\\,\\mathrm{circ}(r/R)\\,\\exp(i \\sum_j c_j Z_j)`."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":func:`project_hermite_gauss`: complex coefficients :math:`c_{nm} = "
"\\langle \\mathrm{HG}_{nm}, U\\rangle` on the orthonormal Hermite-Gauss "
"modes of a waist :math:`w` (the modes of "
":mod:`lumos.symbolic.closed_forms` at their waist)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:12 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":func:`project_laguerre_gauss`: the same on the Laguerre-Gauss modes "
":math:`\\mathrm{LG}_{p\\ell}` (complex modes: :math:`c_{p\\ell} = "
"\\langle \\mathrm{LG}_{p\\ell}, U\\rangle` with the conjugate);"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:15 of
msgid ""
":func:`project_lp`: LP modes of a step-index fibre (Gloge 1971), by least"
" squares;"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:16 of
msgid ""
":func:`project_fourier`: the ``n_terms`` largest terms of the discrete "
"Fourier series of the field."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:17 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":func:`fit_gaussian`: Gaussian beam :math:`A e^{-\\rho^2/w^2} "
"e^{ik\\rho^2/2R} e^{i\\phi}` around :math:`(x_0, y_0)`, from weighted "
"least squares on :math:`\\ln|U|` and on the phase."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:19 of
msgid ""
":func:`fit_airy`: Airy pattern :math:`I_0 [2J_1(v)/v]^2`, :math:`v = \\pi"
" \\rho / s`, by non-linear least squares (``s = λf/D``)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:21 of
msgid ""
":func:`sparse_regression`: sequentially thresholded least squares "
"(Brunton, Proctor & Kutz 2016, PNAS 113, 3932) on monomials :math:`X^i "
"Y^j` of the reduced coordinates :math:`X = x / L`, :math:`Y = y / L`."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.symbolic.reconstruct:23 of
msgid ""
":func:`symbolic_regression`: genetic symbolic regression with PySR "
"(Cranmer 2023), optional."
msgstr ""

