msgstr ""

#: lumos.hardware.protocol:3 of
msgid "Specification: ``docs/hardware/lumoslabs_protocol.md``. In short:"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.hardware.protocol:5 of
msgid ""
"one command per line, ``VERB [arg ...]``, ``\\n``-terminated; verbs are "
"case-insensitive, queries end with ``?``;"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.hardware.protocol:7 of
msgid ""
"arguments and values are tokens separated by spaces: integers (``3``), "
"reals (``0.25``, ``1e-12``), words (``ON``) and **quantities** "
"``value[unit]`` (``12.5[mm]``, ``4[mm/s]``), units in astropy notation;"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.hardware.protocol:9 of
msgid ""
"replies are ``OK [value ...]`` or ``ERR <code> <message>``; the codes are"
" listed in :data:`ERRORS`;"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.hardware.protocol:10 of
msgid ""
"arrays (images) travel as three tokens: dtype, shape (``3x4``) and "
"``b64:`` followed by the base64 of the little-endian bytes "
"(:func:`encode_array`)."
msgstr ""

